<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pressōrĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>That serves for pressing</i> grapes, olives, etc.
			(postAug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pressoria vasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pressōrĭum</span></b> , ii,
				n., <i>a press</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Amm. 28, 4, 19</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exprimere in pressorio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. Val. 2, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
